<b>The Iron Athletics Under-18 Championship,</b>

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.280
<b>this year, in Cardiff, Wales.</b>

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:01.700
<b>The two finalists battling it out
 are the same as last year.</b>

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>The Heroes Return Again</b>

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>The Heroes Return Again</b>

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.030
<b>The Heroes Return Again</b>

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.700
<b>The defending champion, all the way from Japan, Nanami Takatsuki,</b>

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.540
<b>and last year's runner-up, Shinku Izumi.</b>

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.870
<b>Will Nanami Takatsuki, the dainty but brave ninja blood,</b>

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.290
<b>go on to win two times in a row?</b>

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.050
<b>Or will Shinku Izumi, Pride of Great Britain, get his chance this time?</b>

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.420
<b>It's a tie!</b>

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.260
<b>The two bells ring at the same time!</b>

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.720
<b>Yes!</b>

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.800
<b>Absolutely amazing!</b>

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.470
<b>Unheard of!</b>

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:32.190
<b>We have two champions for the first time ever in the Iron Athletics Under-18.</b>

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.470
<b>I've finally caught up to you!</b>

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.140
<b>And next time, I'll beat you!</b>

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.060
<b>There's no way I'll let that happen!</b>

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.350
<b>Congratulations, Nanami Takatsuki,</b>

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.610
<b>and well done, Shinku Izumi!</b>

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.940
<b>We'll be looking forward to another exciting round of games next year.</b>

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:50.080
<b>Earth / Tokino, Kinokawa, Japan</b>

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.670
<b>Tied for first...</b>

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.630
<b>They're both so amazing.</b>

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.720
<b>Shoot! I need to hurry!</b>

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:12.100
<b>Filianno Castle, Biscotti Republic</b>

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.030
<b>Watch your posture!</b>

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.410
<b>Always think ahead!</b>

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.280
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.530
<b>Next!</b>

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.740
<b>Captain Eclair's really giving it her all today.</b>

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.120
<b>Of course.</b>

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:33.660
<b>After all, today—</b>

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.000
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.080
<b>Next!</b>

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.000
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:55.980
<b>I can't wait to play with Hero-sama again!</b>

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.110
<b>I've missed you so much!</b>

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:04.070
<b><i>All three kingdoms will be summoning their heroes today.</i></b>

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:13.330
<b>Vendetta Castle, Galette</b>

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:21.090
<b><i>Shinku and Nanami, who are in England for a competition, will be coming straight to Biscotti and Galette.</i></b>

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:26.090
<b>Hero King's Hill, Principality of Pastillage</b>

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:26.090
<b>Rebecca-san, Pastillage's hero,</b>

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.850
<b>is going to Pastillage from Kinokawa.</b>

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.350
<b>Oh!</b>

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.610
<b>Let's go, Chouze!</b>

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:50.110
<b>Earth / London, England</b>

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.450
<b>Tatsumaki! Cheney!</b>

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.040
<b>Thanks for coming!</b>

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.040
<b>Looks like it's about to rain.</b>

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.670
<b>We should get going.</b>

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.670
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.240
<b>Cou-sama!</b>

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.280
<b>Rebecca!</b>

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.250
<b>Welcome back!</b>

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.830
<b>I missed you, Cou-sama!</b>

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.550
<b>Why are we falling together?</b>

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:19.430
<b>Aren't we supposed to be going to different places?</b>

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:23.140
<b>I'm not sure, but it feels a little...</b>

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.820
<b>Hey! My stuff!</b>

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.460
<b>That was a close one...</b>

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.290
<b>Seriously...</b>

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.210
<b>But...</b>

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.050
<b>where are we?</b>

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.680
<b>Lightning struck the building as the summoning started.</b>

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.100
<b>Maybe that messed up the summoning.</b>

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.270
<b>Our stuff is gone,</b>

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:14.070
<b>and I'm worried about Tatsumaki and Cheney.</b>

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.030
<b>Let's just get out of this tree for now.</b>

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:16.950
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.200
<b>You okay?</b>

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.450
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.690
<b>Nanami!</b>

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.450
<b>Thanks, Shinku...</b>

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.080
<b>Just in time...</b>

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.080
<b>Now, what to do...</b>

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.170
<b>We <i>did</i> see Biscotti on the way down, right?</b>

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.340
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.970
<b>Well, we're definitely somewhere in Flonyard then.</b>

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.130
<b>Let's go find our stuff first.</b>

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.510
<b>Sounds good.</b>

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.560
<b>We should be able to get in contact with everyone then.</b>

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.600
<b>By the way, you can put me down now.</b>

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.440
<b>Where <i>are</i> we?</b>

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.150
<b>Oh, I read about those in Galette!</b>

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.780
<b>They're edible!</b>

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.040
<b>Those look like dinosaurs.</b>

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.170
<b>Seriously, where <i>are</i> we?</b>

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.130
<b>Judging from the stars,</b>

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.510
<b>I think Galette is that way.</b>

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:06.010
<b>Well, in the worst case we'll at least be able to walk there.</b>

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:21.530
<b>The wilderness here is a little over-the-top!</b>

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.620
<b>How about jumping into that river?</b>

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.750
<b>Probably better than hanging on forever!</b>

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.790
<b>I should've brought my swimsuit!</b>

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.840
<b>What a day...</b>

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:48.100
<b>Not quite the time of year for diving, is it?</b>

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.390
<b>Nope.</b>

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.900
<b>I hope Tatsumaki and Cheney are all right.</b>

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.280
<b>I wonder if Becky made it to Pastillage all right.</b>

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:07.030
<b>We're probably in this situation because of the lightning,</b>

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.490
<b>so I'm sure she's fine.</b>

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.540
<b>I guess.</b>

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.790
<b>We need to find our stuff and call them.</b>

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.420
<b>What now?!</b>

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.190
<b>Wh-What's going on?!</b>

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:45.780
<b>Let's see...</b>

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.240
<b>There's a tree...</b>

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.280
<b>Then this happens...</b>

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.370
<b>and then...</b>

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.870
<b>Right...</b>

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:12.100
<b>I don't think I can keep going!</b>

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.100
<b>Shoo, dragons!</b>

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.790
<b>This is the Dragons' Forest.</b>

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.500
<b>Humans should stay away.</b>

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.810
<b>Yuki-chan...</b>

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.690
<b>I smell trouble.</b>

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.400
<b>Line up!</b>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.900
<b>Chop-chop!</b>

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.610
<b>Princess!</b>

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:12.280
<b>Hero Search Party Advance Team, heading out!</b>

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.910
<b>Understood!</b>

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.290
<b>The main force will catch up to you shortly!</b>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.790
<b>Company, full speed ahead!</b>

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.500
<b>Rico...</b>

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:28.470
<b>Yukkii should be here from Fugetsu-an soon!</b>

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:32.800
<b>I'm certain that the heroes are just lost!</b>

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.350
<b>So...</b>

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Yes.</b>

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.560
<b>We need to find them as soon as possible.</b>

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.820
<b>Hey, Sister!</b>

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.820
<b>Lord Gaul.</b>

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.900
<b>What's taking you so long?!</b>

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.490
<b>Can't we leave yet?</b>

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.700
<b>Be patient, Gaul.</b>

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.790
<b>Charging in without a plan won't do us any good.</b>

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:05.090
<b>We're currently gathering information together with Biscotti and Pastillage.</b>

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>Gaul-sama!</b>

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.760
<b>Search party's in the courtyard and ready to roll!</b>

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.720
<b>We can leave any time!</b>

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.260
<b>Gotcha!</b>

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:21.390
<b>I'll leave the brainy work to you guys.</b>

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.980
<b>I'm gonna go out and look for her!</b>

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.270
<b>But...</b>

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:25.980
<b>Let him.</b>

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.650
<b>Gaul, you lead the advance team.</b>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.240
<b>See if you can find any clues.</b>

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.530
<b>Roger!</b>

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:36.370
<b>Oh well.</b>

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:40.000
<b>General Godwin, please accompany him.</b>

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.040
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.960
<b>A summoning mishap?!</b>

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.130
<b>Yes. In theory, it never should have happened,</b>

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:55.300
<b>but something must have changed the destination of the summoning.</b>

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.470
<b>Biscotti and Galette have already dispatched search parties.</b>

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.890
<b>Pastillage can search from the skies!</b>

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.140
<b>Cou-sama!</b>

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:04.980
<b>Yes.</b>

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.110
<b>We're ready to depart on your command.</b>

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.940
<b>Then go!</b>

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:15.070
<b>Find the Heroes Shinku and Nanami as soon as possible!</b>

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:15.780
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:15.780
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.240
<b>Let's take to the skies, Rebecca!</b>

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.120
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.630
<b>Heroes?</b>

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.790
<b>Yep.</b>

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.460
<b>I'm Shinku Izumi, Hero of Biscotti.</b>

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:36.130
<b>And I'm Takatsuki Nanami, Hero of Galette!</b>

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.510
<b>I don't like liars.</b>

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.760
<b>What?!</b>

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.310
<b>I do not know very much about humans,</b>

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.140
<b>but the Heroes I know are different from you.</b>

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:49.820
<b>They should be much more elegant, in flamboyant clothing.</b>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:55.320
<b>Children in rags couldn't possibly be considered Heroes.</b>

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.280
<b>Hold on, I can explain...</b>

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.200
<b>Also...</b>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.160
<b>Heroes should have their nation's sacred weapons.</b>

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.580
<b>Right, those!</b>

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:11.170
<b>We lost our weapons and outfits when we were summoned.</b>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.340
<b>Here, watch this!</b>

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.110
<b>The Hero, Shinku,</b>

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.480
<b>and the Hero, Nanami,</b>

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.440
<b>back in action!</b>

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.700
<b>Not bad.</b>

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.070
<b>Right?!</b>

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.830
<b>Yeah, and have you seen those war shows?</b>

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.120
<b>We're pretty well known from those!</b>

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.460
<b>Ever heard of Union Fest?</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.540
<b>No.</b>

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:56.420
<b>My home does not have a television.</b>

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.340
<b>I see...</b>

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.010
<b>Anyway, you are in the Dragons' Forest.</b>

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.140
<b>Humans from outside should not be here.</b>

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:09.020
<b>There are many dangers that lie in this forest.</b>

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.690
<b>You got that right...</b>

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.940
<b>Also...</b>

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.690
<b>Also... what?</b>

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:17.440
<b>Demons have been appearing around here lately.</b>

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.150
<b>Demons?</b>

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.700
<b>Pega, you're back.</b>

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:29.660
<b>Nanami!</b>

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.960
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.590
<b>That's my keychain!</b>

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.510
<b>I had it on my bag!</b>

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:38.720
<b>I see.</b>

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.970
<b>Pega, take us to where you found this.</b>

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.720
<b>We will help you find your bags.</b>

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:52.230
<b>Then, I will guide you out of the forest so you can go home.</b>

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:52.810
<b>Understood?</b>

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.730
<b>A-All right.</b>

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.230
<b>Sounds good to me.</b>

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.370
<b>She's so fast!</b>

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.410
<b>For real!</b>

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.210
<b>There it is!</b>

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.170
<b>There's my stuff!</b>

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.300
<b>Found mine, too!</b>

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.720
<b>Thank you so much, Pega!</b>

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:30.640
<b>Oh, you can have that if you want.</b>

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.810
<b>If you're done here, I'll lead you out now.</b>

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:38.570
<b>Wait here while I find a safe way out.</b>

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.440
<b>Let's go, Pega.</b>

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:53.580
<b><i>Another abnormally large ...</i></b>

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:57.750
<b><i>They used to be completely docile.</i></b>

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.800
<b><i>It must be because the Dragon-Eaters came here!</i></b>

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.050
<b>Did you hear that?</b>

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:07.930
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.860
<b>I'll save you!</b>

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.370
<b><i>The Dragon-Eaters have made it this deep!</i></b>

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.540
<b><i>I need to take action, quickly.</i></b>

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.060
<b>Boomerang...</b>

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.560
<b>Slash!</b>

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.080
<b>Superheated...</b>

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.590
<b>Flame Palm Strike!</b>

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.490
<b>Once again...</b>

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.580
<b>I'm Takatsuki Nanami, Hero of Galette,</b>

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.540
<b>and I'm Shinku Izumi, Hero of Biscotti.</b>

